# ==============================================
# PSpice for TI / OrCAD Capture + PSpice
# ==============================================

# --- KEEP (do NOT ignore) ---
# *.opj   project file
# *.dsn   schematic design
# *.sim   simulation profiles (inside *-PSpiceFiles/)
# *.prb   probe/waveform window settings (optional, small)
# *.lib, *.olb, *.mod   your own models / symbol libraries

# --- Simulation output (regenerated on every run) ---
*.dat
*.out
*.out.*
*.[0-9]OP
*.msg
*_pspmetadata.db
# Unsure: likely run-time state, uncomment once verified as regenerated
# *.mif
# *.json
*.smk
*.log

# --- Netlists & aliases (regenerated from the schematic) ---
*.net
*.als
*.cir
!models/**/*.cir

# --- External libraries and models ---
vendor/

# --- Backups, locks, journals, temp files ---
*.DBK
*.dbk
*.bak
*.BAK
*.lck
*.DSNlck
*.dsnlck
*.OPJlck
*.opjlck
*.jrl
*.tmp
*.$$$
*~
~$*

# --- Capture / PSpice per-user settings & caches ---
*.ini
*.cache
**/autobackup/
**/AutoBackup/
**/PSpiceTemp/

# --- Exports (re-create as needed) ---
*.pdf
*.csv
*.png

# --- OS cruft ---
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
